          "description": "<div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div><strong>This Year in Music</strong> is back and we celebrating all the legendary and glamorous hits of <strong>2007</strong>! We\u2019re welcoming performers from all over the city to honor one iconic year through singing, dancing, storytelling, and epic sketch comedy. So dust off your shutter shades, get ready to crank that 2007 nostalgia - we guarantee it\u2019ll be a sweet escape!<br><br><strong>Featuring:</strong><br>Amber Linde<br>Arne Parrott<br>Brad Johnson<br>Brixton McMillan<br>Carter Wright<br>Chris Jowett<br>Claudia Baffo<br>Courtney Crary<br>Dan Shea<br>Elise Leonhart<br>James Dugan<br>Jamie Burns<br>Jordan Stafford<br>Kelly Dugan<br>Maria Sharps<br>Matty Vergun<br>Molly Jones<br>Molly Walburn<br>Niah Whitley<br>Rob Grabowski<br>The Qs<br>Sarah Dell Amico<br>Tina Arfaee<br>Yassi Baharloo<br><br>bringing you the hits of Rihanna, Amy Winehouse, Paramore, T-Pain, Fall Out Boy, Fergie, MGMT, Radiohead, and MORE!!</div>\n</div>\n"
